NAME: a while with NE
DESCRIPTION: (while (NE x 0) (SUB 1 x)) counts x down to 0 and leaves the loop, then marks done; see behtests/while_ne.beh
SRC:
(let (x 3)
  (let (done 0)
    (seq
      (while (NE x 0) (SUB 1 x))
      (MOV 1 done)
      (JMP 0)
      (DAT (store done) (store x)))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

_WHI5 
  SNE.B  $_LET1 , #0     
  JMP    $_WHF5 , #0     
  SUB.AB #1     , $_LET1 
  JMP    $_WHI5 , #0     
_WHF5 
  MOV.A  #1     , $_LET2 
  JMP    #0     , #0     
_LET2 
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #3     
  DAT    $0     , $0     